  "privacyText": "MTC-iPTv does not require an account and does not collect your name, email, IP address, precise location or any advertising ID. Favorites, history, reminders and settings stay on your device.\n\nIf statistics are enabled, the app sends for each playback attempt: the server used (not its link), success or failure and the error type, start time, watch time (rounded) and resolution — with a random device ID, platform, app version, app language and an approximate country. Raw events are kept for 30 days, then only daily totals without device IDs; the device record is deleted 90 days after it was last seen. You can turn statistics off or reset the device ID (which deletes the previous one) in Settings.\n\nProblem reports contain only what you write, plus technical details if you choose to attach them.",
